<title>FRANCE: Saint-Gobain sells unit to Qualis.</title>
<headline>Saint-Gobain sells unit to Qualis.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Saint-Gobain said on Monday that its packaging unit had sold the subsidiary SGCC to Groupe Qualis.</p>
<p>A spokesman said the turnover of the unit sold, which was 99 percent held by Saint-Gobain, was 160 million francs in 1996 but that the sale details would not be revealed.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
